<%#
  Landing pública (visitante). Mesma linguagem do app e do login do site.

  Roteiro da página — uma ideia por dobra (Apple), tipo grande e um acento
  só (Spotify), muito respiro (Wiemer):
    1. Hero: "Chegou. Lavou. Vazou." entrando palavra a palavra (tipografia
       cinética — a abertura do app) + o app "vivo" num celular ao lado
       (só do iPad pra cima; no celular o hero é só o texto).
    2. Como funciona em 3 passos, com o celular preso trocando de tela.
    3. Last Minute: a vaga da próxima meia hora nos lava-rápidos até 5 km,
       em fundo obsidiana, com a próxima marca de meia hora de verdade.
    4. Números (regras do produto, contam ao aparecer).
    5. Perto de você: cards lado a lado, presos à rolagem em qualquer tela,
       com verso no hover e detalhe que cresce do card.
    6. Para lava-rápidos: abas com as funções e a tela do app de cada uma.
    7. Fecho: "Lava-rápido sem fila." enchendo de coral.

  Movimento (inspiração: viture.com — a rolagem conta a história): rolagem
  suave (Lenis) e animação presa à rolagem (GSAP ScrollTrigger), as duas em
  public/vendor. Sem as bibliotecas ou com prefers-reduced-motion, a página
  fica estática e completa.

  Fundo e destaque (2026-11-18, escolhidos na prévia): curvas de nível em
  WebGL atrás da página inteira, num canvas fixo, como o fundo do site do
  Lando Norris. O relevo sobe onde o cursor passa (no toque, passeia
  sozinho), corre mais devagar que a página e muda de cor com a seção: areia
  na seção do dono e creme sobre obsidiana no Disponível, acompanhando o
  cartão que cresce. A palavra de destaque de cada título vai em Fraunces
  itálica coral (.lh-dest); o resto segue Space Grotesk e Inter. Sem WebGL ou
  com prefers-reduced-motion, as seções voltam às cores chapadas de antes.

  Toda frase aqui é fato do produto (conferido no código): Disponível = 30
  min e 35% pago no app; lembrete na véspera; avaliação só de quem foi
  atendido; dono grátis na fase de testes. Movimento respeita
  prefers-reduced-motion.
%>
<%
  shops = (@nearby_car_washes || []).first(6)
  phone_shops = shops.first(3)
  # Cards do Last minute no celular do hero: lojas reais da Loov (nome,
  # rua, bairro, menor preço e nota). A distância é ilustrativa, já que o
  # visitante ainda não deu a localização.
  lm_cards = phone_shops.first(2).each_with_index.map do |cw, i|
    precos = cw.services.map { |sv| sv.price.to_f }.select(&:positive?)
    media  = cw.reviews.average(:rating)&.to_f
    {
      name:   cw.name,
      street: [cw.try(:logradouro), cw.try(:numero)].compact_blank.join(", "),
      bairro: cw.try(:bairro).presence || cw.try(:cidade).presence || "Perto de você",
      price:  precos.any? ? precos.min.round.to_s : "40",
      dist:   ["1,2 km", "2,4 km"][i],
      rating: media ? format("%.1f", media).tr(".", ",") : nil
    }
  end
  if lm_cards.empty?
    lm_cards = [
      { name: "Lava-rápido do bairro", street: "", bairro: "Perto de você", price: "40", dist: "1,2 km", rating: "4,8" },
      { name: "Estética automotiva",   street: "", bairro: "Perto de você", price: "55", dist: "2,4 km", rating: "4,6" }
    ]
  end
%>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght,SOFT,WONK@1,9..144,500..700,0..100,0..1&display=swap">
<style>
  .lh { background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink); overflow-x: clip; }
  .lh *, .lh *::before, .lh *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .lh-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; }
  .lh h1, .lh h2, .lh h3 { margin: 0; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif !important; font-weight: 700; color: inherit; }
  .lh p { margin: 0; }
  .lh-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--coral-700);
  }
  .lh-eyebrow::before { content: ""; width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--coral-500); }

  /* Botões */
  .lh-btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    height: 56px; padding: 0 28px; border-radius: 9999px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .1px;
    text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, background .15s ease, color .15s ease;
  }
  .lh-btn svg { transition: transform .2s ease; }
  .lh-btn:hover svg { transform: translateX(3px); }
  .lh-btn--primary { background: var(--coral-500); color: #fff !important; box-shadow: 0 12px 28px -12px rgba(221,120,82,.8); }
  .lh-btn--primary:hover { background: var(--coral-700); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .lh-btn--ghost { color: var(--ink) !important; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); background: transparent; }
  .lh-btn--ghost:hover { background: var(--sand); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .lh-btn--light { background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink) !important; }
  .lh-btn--light:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #fff; }

  /* Abertura (~1 s, uma vez por dia): o logo entra e a cortina sobe; o
     hero começa depois dela. Sem movimento, não aparece. */
  .lh-intro { display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 200; background: var(--obsidian); align-items: center; justify-content: center; pointer-events: none; animation: lh-intro-sai .6s cubic-bezier(.7,0,.2,1) .55s forwards; }
  html.lh-abrindo .lh-intro { display: flex; }
  .lh-intro .loov-brand { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(250,250,246,.22); animation: lh-intro-logo .45s cubic-bezier(.3,1.6,.5,1) both; }
  @keyframes lh-intro-logo { from { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 0; } to { transform: scale(2); opacity: 1; } }
  @keyframes lh-intro-sai { from { clip-path: inset(0 0 0 0); } to { clip-path: inset(0 0 100% 0); visibility: hidden; } }
  html.lh-abrindo .lh-kinetic span:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: .8s; }
  html.lh-abrindo .lh-kinetic span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 1.2s; }
  html.lh-abrindo .lh-kinetic span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 1.6s; }
  html.lh-abrindo .lh-hero-after { animation-delay: 2.1s; }
  html.lh-abrindo .lh-phone-stage { animation-delay: 1.3s; }

  /* Destaque: uma fonte só pras palavras que pedem atenção, sempre coral
     (como a Brier em lime no site do Lando). */
  .lh .lh-dest { font-family: 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: 600; font-variation-settings: 'SOFT' 100, 'WONK' 1, 'opsz' 144; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--coral-500); }

  /* Botões: o texto rola letra a letra no hover (só com mouse) */
  .lh-roll { display: inline-flex; overflow: hidden; height: 1.25em; line-height: 1.25em; white-space: pre; }
  .lh-roll i { font-style: normal; display: inline-block; text-shadow: 0 1.25em currentColor; transition: transform .45s cubic-bezier(.7,0,.2,1); transition-delay: calc(var(--i) * 14ms); }
  @media (hover: hover) { .lh-btn:hover .lh-roll i, .lh-near-btn:hover .lh-roll i { transform: translateY(-1.25em); } }

  /* Curvas de nível atrás da página: as seções deixam o fundo pro canvas */
  .lh-campo-cv { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .lh-campo-cv[hidden] { display: none; }
  .lh { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .lh.lh-campo { background: transparent; }
  .lh.lh-campo .lh-hero::before { display: none; }
  .lh.lh-campo .lh-dark { background: transparent; }
  .lh.lh-campo #para-lava-rapidos { background: transparent; }

  /* Revelar ao rolar */
  .lh-reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px); transition: opacity .8s ease, transform .8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1); }
  .lh-reveal.is-in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .lh-reveal[data-delay="1"] { transition-delay: .1s; }
  .lh-reveal[data-delay="2"] { transition-delay: .2s; }
  .lh-reveal[data-delay="3"] { transition-delay: .3s; }

  /* ── 1. Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lh-hero { position: relative; min-height: min(calc(100svh - 60px), 940px); margin-top: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 56px 0 32px; }
  .lh-hero::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
    width: 820px; height: 820px; right: -180px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(221,120,82,.22), rgba(221,120,82,0) 72%);
    animation: lh-breathe 10s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes lh-breathe { 50% { transform: translateY(-54%) scale(1.07); } }
  .lh-hero-grid { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, .85fr); align-items: center; gap: 48px; }
  .lh-kinetic { font-size: clamp(72px, 10.5vw, 168px) !important; line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; margin-top: 22px !important; }
  .lh-kinetic span { display: block; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(38%); filter: blur(14px); animation: lh-word 1s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) forwards; }
  .lh-kinetic span:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: .1s; }
  .lh-kinetic span:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: .5s; }
  .lh-kinetic span:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: .9s; padding-right: .08em; }
  @keyframes lh-word { to { opacity: 1; transform: none; filter: none; } }
  .lh-hero-after { opacity: 0; animation: lh-fade .9s ease 1.45s forwards; }
  @keyframes lh-fade { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }
  .lh-lead { margin-top: 28px !important; max-width: 34ch; font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 21px); line-height: 1.5; color: var(--graphite); }
  .lh-lead strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .lh-hero-cta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .lh-dot-live { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2fa36b; box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(47,163,107,.5); animation: lh-ping 2s ease-out infinite; }
  @keyframes lh-ping { 70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(47,163,107,0); } 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(47,163,107,0); } }

  /* Celular com o app */
  .lh-phone-stage { display: flex; justify-content: center; perspective: 1400px; opacity: 0; animation: lh-fade 1.1s ease .7s forwards; }
  /* Em notebook a tela é baixa: o celular encolhe (zoom vem do JS, --hz) pra caber inteiro. */
  @media (min-width: 961px) { .lh-hero .lh-phone-stage { zoom: var(--hz, 1); align-self: start; } }
  .lh-phone {
    position: relative; width: 320px; height: 650px; border-radius: 52px; padding: 12px;
    background: var(--obsidian);
    box-shadow: 0 50px 100px -30px rgba(40,35,28,.45), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06) inset;
    transform: rotateY(-8deg) rotateX(4deg); transition: transform .4s ease; will-change: transform;
  }
  .lh-screen { position: relative; height: 100%; border-radius: 41px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--cream); padding: 52px 18px 18px; }
  .lh-notch { position: absolute; top: 12px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 100px; height: 28px; border-radius: 20px; background: var(--obsidian); }
  .lh-app-hi { font-size: 13px; color: var(--graphite); }
  .lh-app-title { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 25px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 2px 0 16px; }
  .lh-app-chips { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .lh-app-chip { white-space: nowrap; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; padding: 7px 11px; border-radius: 99px; border: 1px solid var(--stone); color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); }
  .lh-app-chip.is-on { background: var(--coral-500); border-color: var(--coral-500); color: #fff; }
  .lh-app-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--stone); margin-bottom: 9px; }
  /* Logo da loja (shared/_loov_logos): o mesmo emblema da home do cliente,
     do app e do Disponível. O SVG tem forma própria, então o slot é neutro. */
  .lh-app-av { flex: 0 0 40px; height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .lh-app-av svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
  .lh-app-name { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .lh-app-sub { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--graphite); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .lh-status { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 1px; padding: 4px 7px; border-radius: 6px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .lh-status.is-open { background: #dcefe3; color: #23744a; }
  .lh-status.is-closed { background: var(--sand); color: var(--graphite); }
  .lh-toast {
    position: absolute; left: 14px; right: 14px; bottom: 18px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 36px -12px rgba(26,22,18,.55);
    transform: translateY(140%); animation: lh-toast 7s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1) 2.4s infinite;
  }
  .lh-toast-check { flex: 0 0 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2fa36b; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .lh-toast b { display: block; font-size: 13.5px; }
  .lh-toast span { font-size: 12px; color: #cfc8bb; }
  /* Home do cliente no celular do hero: desenhada em pontos de iPhone
     (390 de largura, medidas do HomeScreen do app) e reduzida pra tela do
     aparelho (296px de largura útil → 296/390). */
  .lh-screen--home { padding: 0; }
  .lh-screen--home .lh-notch { z-index: 3; }
  .ah { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 390px; height: 826px; transform: scale(.759); transform-origin: 0 0; background: var(--cream); color: var(--ink); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
  .ah-status { height: 47px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 4px 30px 0 40px; }
  .ah-status b { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.2px; }
  .ah-sinal { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 2px; height: 12px; }
  .ah-sinal i { width: 3.5px; border-radius: 1px; background: var(--ink); }
  .ah-sinal i:nth-child(1) { height: 4px; } .ah-sinal i:nth-child(2) { height: 6.5px; } .ah-sinal i:nth-child(3) { height: 9px; } .ah-sinal i:nth-child(4) { height: 11.5px; }
  .ah-sinal::after { content: ""; width: 24px; height: 11.5px; margin-left: 6px; border-radius: 3.5px; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); box-sizing: border-box; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ink) 70%, transparent 70%) content-box; padding: 1.5px; }
  .ah-head { padding: 6px 20px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--stone); }
  .ah-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .ah-loc { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 8px 12px; margin-left: -8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .ah-av { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid var(--coral-500); color: var(--coral-500); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; }
  .ah-hi { display: flex; align-items: center; margin: -2px 0 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--graphite); }
  .ah-mao { margin-left: 5px; font-size: 17px; display: inline-block; transform-origin: 70% 80%; animation: ah-mao 2.4s ease-in-out 1.6s 2; }
  @keyframes ah-mao { 0%, 60%, 100% { transform: none; } 10%, 30% { transform: rotate(14deg); } 20%, 40% { transform: rotate(-8deg); } }
  .ah-busca { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; height: 46px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 23px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--stone); font-size: 14px; color: var(--ash); }
  .ah-sec { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 0 20px 4px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .ah-sec-t, .ah-cat-t { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -.4px; line-height: 28px; }
  .ah-link { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--coral-500); }
  .lh .ah-helper { padding: 0 20px; margin: 2px 0 12px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--graphite); }
  .ah-strip { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 0 20px 14px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 18px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--stone); }
  .ah-strip-ic { flex: 0 0 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--coral-500); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .ah-strip-tx { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .ah-strip-tx small { display: block; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1.6px; color: var(--graphite); }
  .ah-strip-tx b { display: block; margin-top: 2px; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px; line-height: 28px; letter-spacing: -.8px; }
  .ah-strip-chip { padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--coral-50, #fbeae3); color: var(--coral-700, #9c4930); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
  .ah-lm { display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 0 20px 24px; overflow: hidden; }
  .ah-lm-card { position: relative; flex: 0 0 264px; height: 214px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-radius: 22px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(40,35,28,.15); }
  .ah-lm-rate { position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 100px; background: rgba(250,250,246,.08); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; }
  .ah-lm-stats { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 26px 8px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(250,250,246,.08); }
  .ah-lm-stats > span { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .ah-lm-stats b { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 30px; line-height: 34px; letter-spacing: -1px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .ah-lm-stats b small { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .ah-lm-stats em { margin-top: 8px; font-style: normal; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 1.6px; color: rgba(250,250,246,.55); }
  .ah-lm-stats > i { width: 1px; height: 44px; background: rgba(250,250,246,.12); }
  .ah-lm-shop { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; }
  .ah-lm-logo { flex: 0 0 40px; height: 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .ah-lm-logo svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
  .ah-lm-tx { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .ah-lm-tx b { display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; line-height: 18px; letter-spacing: -.3px; }
  .ah-lm-tx small { display: block; margin-top: 2px; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(250,250,246,.55); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
  .ah-cat-t { padding: 0 20px; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .ah-cats { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding-left: 20px; overflow: hidden; }
  .ah-cats span { flex: 0 0 98px; height: 88px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; padding: 0 8px; border-radius: 16px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--stone); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
  .ah-tabs { position: absolute; left: 12px; right: 12px; bottom: 18px; height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-around; padding: 0 8px; border-radius: 9999px; background: var(--ink); box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(25,20,15,.18); }
  .ah-tabs span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; height: 48px; min-width: 48px; padding: 0 14px; justify-content: center; border-radius: 9999px; color: var(--cream); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .ah-tabs span.is-on { background: var(--coral-500); }
  @keyframes lh-toast { 0% { transform: translateY(140%); } 10%, 72% { transform: none; } 82%, 100% { transform: translateY(140%); } }

  /* ── 3. Como funciona ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lh-section { padding: 140px 0; }
  .lh-h2 { font-size: clamp(40px, 5.2vw, 76px) !important; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.045em; max-width: 14ch; margin-top: 18px !important; }

  /* ── 4. Disponível ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .lh-dark { position: relative; background: var(--obsidian); color: var(--cream); border-radius: 44px; margin: 0 16px; overflow: hidden; isolation: isolate; }
  .lh-dark::before { content: ""; position: absolute; z-index: -1; width: 900px; height: 900px; left: -300px; bottom: -520px; background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(221,120,82,.35), rgba(221,120,82,0) 70%); }
  .lh-dark .lh-eyebrow { color: var(--coral-300); }
  .lh-dark-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, .9fr); gap: 56px; align-items: center; }
  .lh-dark p.lh-dark-lead { margin-top: 28px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.55; color: #cfc8bb; max-width: 38ch; }
  .lh-dark p.lh-dark-lead strong { color: var(--cream); font-weight: 600; }
  .lh-lm-steps { list-style: none; margin: 30px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0; counter-reset: lm; max-width: 440px; }
  .lh-lm-steps li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 34px 1fr; gap: 2px 14px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(250,250,246,.14); counter-increment: lm; }
  .lh-lm-steps li::before { content: counter(lm); grid-row: span 2; width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid var(--coral-300); color: var(--coral-300); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .lh-lm-steps b { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--cream); }
  .lh-lm-steps span { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.45; color: #cfc8bb; }
  .lh-regua { margin-top: 26px; }
  .lh-regua-linha { position: relative; height: 6px; border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(250,250,246,.12); }
  .lh-regua-linha::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: -6px; width: 2px; height: 18px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--coral-500); transform: translateX(-50%); }
  .lh-regua-linha i { position: absolute; top: 50%; left: var(--p, 20%); width: 16px; height: 16px; margin: -8px 0 0 -8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cream); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(250,250,246,.14); transition: left 1s linear; }
  .lh-regua-marcas { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 12px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #8f877a; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .lh-regua-marcas .is-vaga { color: var(--coral-300); }
  .lh-slot-k { display: block; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.6px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8f877a; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .lh-slot-tag b { color: var(--cream); font-weight: 500; margin-left: 4px; }
  .lh-slot { border-radius: 32px; padding: 36px; background: rgba(250,250,246,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(250,250,246,.12); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); }
  .lh-slot-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .lh-slot-tag { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.6px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--coral-300); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .lh-slot-time { margin-top: 26px; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(64px, 7vw, 104px); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .lh-slot-cap { margin-top: 8px; color: #cfc8bb; font-size: 15px; }
  .lh-slot-bar { margin-top: 28px; height: 6px; border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(250,250,246,.12); overflow: hidden; }
  .lh-slot-bar i { display: block; height: 100%; width: 100%; background: var(--coral-500); border-radius: 6px; transform-origin: left; transition: transform 1s linear; }
  .lh-slot-foot { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 28px; }
  .lh-slot-foot div { font-size: 14px; color: #cfc8bb; }
  .lh-slot-foot b { display: block; color: var(--cream); font-size: 16px; }

  /* ── 5. Perto de você: cards lado a lado ─────────────────────────── */
  .lh-near { padding: 140px 0; }
  .lh-near-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .lh-near-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 14px 20px; }
  /* Localização sob demanda: o pedido só aparece quando a pessoa quer ver
     os mais perto (pedir ao abrir a página queimaria a permissão — um "não"
     aqui vale pro site inteiro, inclusive a home depois do cadastro). */
  .lh-near-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; height: 46px; padding: 0 20px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); background: transparent; color: var(--ink); font: inherit; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: background .2s ease, color .2s ease; }
  .lh-near-btn:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); }
  .lh-near-btn[disabled] { opacity: .6; cursor: progress; }
  .lh-near-btn[hidden] { display: none; }
  .lh-near-note { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .5px; color: var(--graphite); }
  .lh-near-note[hidden] { display: none; }
  .lh-near-prog { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--graphite); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .lh-near-bar { width: 120px; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--stone); overflow: hidden; }
  .lh-near-bar i { display: block; height: 100%; width: 100%; background: var(--ink); transform-origin: left; transform: scaleX(.17); }
  .lh-rail { margin-top: 44px; display: flex; gap: 16px; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scrollbar-width: none; margin-inline: -32px; padding: 4px 32px 10px; }
  .lh-rail::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
  .lh-rail.is-pinned { overflow: visible; scroll-snap-type: none; }
  .lh-card { position: relative; flex: 0 0 clamp(196px, 52vw, 228px); aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; scroll-snap-align: start; border-radius: 28px; border: 1px solid var(--stone); background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); overflow: hidden; text-align: left; padding: 0; font: inherit; cursor: pointer; isolation: isolate; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(40,35,28,.04), 0 18px 40px -28px rgba(40,35,28,.5); }
  .lh-card:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .lh-card-f, .lh-card-b { position: absolute; inset: 0; padding: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
  .lh-card-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; }
  .lh-card-av { width: 46px; height: 46px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .lh-card-av svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
  .lh-card-name { display: block; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .lh-card-addr { display: block; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--graphite); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; }
  .lh-card-hint { display: none; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  /* Verso: nasce num círculo a partir do cursor (a troca no hover da Lando) */
  .lh-card-b { background: var(--obsidian); color: var(--cream); clip-path: circle(0px at var(--x, 50%) var(--y, 50%)); transition: clip-path .6s cubic-bezier(.7,0,.2,1); }
  .lh-card-b small { display: block; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ash); }
  .lh-card-big { display: block; margin-top: 8px; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 40px; line-height: .9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .lh-card-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 10px; }
  .lh-card-pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; height: 34px; padding: 0 13px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1.5px solid var(--cream); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) { .lh-card:hover .lh-card-b, .lh-card:focus-visible .lh-card-b { clip-path: circle(150% at var(--x, 50%) var(--y, 50%)); } }
  @media (hover: none) { .lh-card-hint { display: block; } .lh-card-b { display: none; } }

  .lh-motion .lh-near { padding: 0; }
  .lh-motion .lh-near-pin { min-height: 100svh; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 84px 0 40px; }
  .lh-motion .lh-near-pin > .lh-wrap { width: 100%; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .lh-motion .lh-near-pin { padding: 72px 0 24px; }
    .lh-motion .lh-near .lh-h2 { font-size: 36px !important; }
    .lh-motion .lh-rail { margin-top: 24px; }
  }

  /* Detalhe que cresce do card */
  .lh-pop { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 140; pointer-events: none; }
  .lh-pop.is-on { pointer-events: auto; }
  .lh-pop-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(26,22,18,.45); backdrop-filter: blur(4px); opacity: 0; transition: opacity .35s; }
  .lh-pop.is-on .lh-pop-bg { opacity: 1; }
  .lh-pop-card { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; max-height: 88svh; overflow: auto; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); border-radius: 28px 28px 0 0; padding: 22px 20px calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); visibility: hidden; transform-origin: 0 0; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .lh-pop-card { left: 50%; right: auto; bottom: auto; top: 50%; width: 560px; border-radius: 28px; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); padding: 28px; } }
  .lh-pop-in > * { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); transition: opacity .4s, transform .5s cubic-bezier(.7,0,.2,1); }
  .lh-pop.is-ready .lh-pop-in > * { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .lh-pop.is-ready .lh-pop-in > *:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: .05s; }
  .lh-pop.is-ready .lh-pop-in > *:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: .1s; }
  .lh-pop.is-ready .lh-pop-in > *:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: .15s; }
  .lh-pop-top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
  .lh-pop-top .lh-card-av { width: 52px; height: 52px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .lh-pop-top b { display: block; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .lh-pop-top span.s { display: block; margin-top: 2px; color: var(--graphite); font-size: 14px; }
  .lh-pop-x { margin-left: auto; flex-shrink: 0; width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; border: 0; background: var(--sand); color: var(--ink); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; }
  .lh-pop-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .lh-pop-lbl { margin: 22px 0 10px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .lh-svcs { border: 1px solid var(--stone); border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; }
  .lh-svcs div { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; font-size: 15px; }
  .lh-svcs div + div { border-top: 1px solid var(--stone); }
  .lh-svcs small { display: block; color: var(--graphite); font-size: 12.5px; margin-top: 1px; }
  .lh-svcs b { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  .lh-pop .lh-btn { width: 100%; justify-content: center; margin-top: 22px; }

  /* ── 6. Para lava-rápidos: abas + tela do app ────────────────────── */
  .lh-dono-head { max-width: 760px; }
  .lh-dono-lead { margin-top: 22px !important; max-width: 52ch; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--graphite); }
  .lh-dono-lead strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
  .lh-dono-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 360px; gap: 64px; align-items: center; margin-top: 48px; }
  .lh-feats { display: grid; gap: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--stone); }
  .lh-feat { position: relative; display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; padding: 22px 0 20px; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--stone); background: transparent; color: var(--ink); font: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
  .lh-feat-t { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--ash); transition: color .3s; }
  .lh-feat.is-on .lh-feat-t, .lh-feat:hover .lh-feat-t { color: var(--ink); }
  .lh-feat-s { display: block; max-height: 0; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 0; max-width: 46ch; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--graphite); transition: max-height .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1), opacity .35s, margin .45s; }
  .lh-feat.is-on .lh-feat-s { max-height: 140px; opacity: 1; margin-top: 8px; }
  .lh-feat-bar { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: -1px; height: 2px; overflow: hidden; }
  .lh-feat-bar b { display: block; height: 100%; background: var(--ink); transform-origin: left; transform: scaleX(0); }
  .lh-dono-phone { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  /* Notebook: lista mais compacta pra caber junto do celular (encolhido no JS, --dz). */
  @media (min-width: 961px) { .lh-dono-phone { zoom: var(--dz, 1); } }
  @media (min-width: 961px) and (max-height: 860px) {
    .lh-feat { padding: 14px 0 12px; }
    .lh-feat-t { font-size: 22px; }
    .lh-feat-s { font-size: 15px; }
  }
  .lh-phone--dono { transform: rotateY(-6deg) rotateX(3deg); }
  /* AI Insights (OwnerAiInsightsScreen), na escala das outras telas do dono */
  .ds-ai-head { display: flex; }
  .ds-ai-btn { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--sand); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .ds-ai-tt { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 9px; margin: 8px 0 12px; }
  .ds-ai-tt b { flex: 1; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 29px; line-height: 30px; letter-spacing: -1.1px; }
  .ds-ai-dec { padding: 16px; border-radius: 20px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--cream); box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -12px rgba(25,20,15,.45); }
  .ds-ai-dec-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 11px; }
  .ds-ai-dec-top small { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-weight: 500; font-size: 7.5px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: var(--coral-300); }
  .ds-ai-dec-top em { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 100px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); font-style: normal; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 6.5px; letter-spacing: 1px; color: var(--sand); }
  .ds-ai-dec-top em i { width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5dc39f; }
  .lh .ds-ai-dec p { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 18.5px; letter-spacing: -.2px; }
  .ds-ai-dec p b, .ds-ai-why p b { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; }
  .ds-ai-rule { display: block; height: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.1); margin: 13px 0 9px; }
  .ds-ai-meta { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 8px; color: var(--ash); }
  .ds-ai-why { margin-top: 13px; }
  .ds-ai-why small { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: 1.4px; color: var(--ash); }
  .lh .ds-ai-why p { font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 16px; color: var(--graphite); }
  .ds-ai-why p b { color: var(--ink); }
  .ds-ai-bh { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; margin: 16px 0 9px; }
  .ds-ai-bh b { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: -.2px; }
  .ds-ai-bh small { font-size: 8.5px; color: var(--ash); }
  .ds-ai-pulse { display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 9px; color: var(--graphite); }
  .ds-ai-pulse span { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px; }
  .ds-ai-pulse b { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: -.4px; }
  .ds-ai-list { border-radius: 15px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--stone); overflow: hidden; }
  .ds-ai-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 11px; }
  .ds-ai-row + .ds-ai-row { border-top: 1px solid var(--sand); }
  .ds-ai-row > i { width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .ds-ai-row > i.is-up { background: rgba(93,195,159,.1); } .ds-ai-row > i.is-down { background: rgba(200,80,80,.1); } .ds-ai-row > i.is-flat { background: rgba(173,166,153,.1); }
  .ds-ai-row b { flex: 1; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; }
  .ds-ai-row em { font-style: normal; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .9px; }
  .lh-ds .is-up { color: #5dc39f; } .lh-ds .is-down { color: #c85050; } .lh-ds .is-flat { color: var(--ash); }
  .ds-ai-chev { margin-left: 2px; }
  .lh-dono-foot { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; margin-top: 56px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--stone); }
  .lh-dono-mais { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .lh-dono-mais li { padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 99px; border: 1px solid var(--stone); background: var(--paper); font-size: 14px; color: var(--graphite); }

  /* Telas do app do dono (dentro do .lh-phone) */
  .lh-ds { position: absolute; inset: 0; padding: 50px 16px 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); transition: opacity .45s ease, transform .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1); background: var(--cream); }
  .lh-ds.is-on { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  .lh-ds.is-dark { background: #1a1612; color: var(--cream); }
  .ds-k { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 1.3px; color: var(--ash); }
  .ds-k.is-coral { color: var(--coral-700); }
  .ds-t { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 21px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin: 2px 0 12px; }
  .is-dark .ds-t { color: var(--cream); }
  .ds-t-lg { font-size: 26px; margin: 6px 0 0; letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
  .ds-pausa { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--stone); font-size: 11px; color: var(--graphite); }
  .ds-pausa small { display: block; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 8.5px; letter-spacing: 1.3px; color: #23744a; margin-bottom: 1px; }
  .ds-sw { flex-shrink: 0; position: relative; width: 34px; height: 20px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--ink); }
  .ds-sw::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 2px; right: 2px; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--paper); }
  .ds-kpis { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .ds-kpis span { border-radius: 12px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--stone); padding: 8px 9px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--graphite); }
  .ds-kpis b { display: block; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--ink); }
  .ds-sec { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin: 14px 0 8px; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
  .ds-sec em { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-style: normal; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 9.5px; padding: 3px 7px; border-radius: 99px; border: 1px solid var(--stone); color: var(--graphite); }
  .ds-sec em i { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5dc39f; }
  .ds-avulso { margin-left: auto; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 10px; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 99px; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); }
  .ds-card { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 9px; padding: 10px; border-radius: 14px; background: var(--paper); border: 1px solid var(--stone); margin-bottom: 7px; }
  .ds-card.is-live { border: 2px solid var(--ink); padding: 9px; }
  .ds-time { flex: 0 0 42px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--sand); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .ds-body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .ds-body b { display: block; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .ds-body small { display: block; font-size: 10px; color: var(--graphite); margin-top: 1px; }
  .ds-placa { font-style: normal; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .8px; }
  .ds-fase { display: flex !important; align-items: center; gap: 5px; margin-top: 5px !important; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 8.5px !important; letter-spacing: .8px; color: var(--ink) !important; }
  .ds-fase i { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5dc39f; }
  .ds-prog { display: block; height: 4px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--sand); margin-top: 5px; overflow: hidden; }
  .ds-prog b { display: block; height: 100%; width: 62%; background: #5dc39f; border-radius: 4px; }
